# 数据库 Schema 设计

> 项目级数据库结构概览，供团队统一遵循。

## 核心表

### Users（用户表）
```sql
CREATE TABLE Users (
    UserId BIGINT PRIMARY KEY IDENTITY(1,1),
    ComId BIGINT NOT NULL,                  -- 租户 ID（多租户隔离）
    Username NVARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    Email NVARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    PasswordHash NVARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    Status INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,          -- 1=正常, 2=禁用, 3=删除
    CreatedAt DATETIME2 NOT NULL DEFAULT GETDATE(),
    UpdatedAt DATETIME2 NOT NULL DEFAULT GETDATE(),
    CONSTRAINT UK_Users_ComId_Username UNIQUE (ComId, Username),
    INDEX IX_Users_ComId (ComId),
    INDEX IX_Users_Email (Email)
);
```

### Orders（订单表）
```sql
CREATE TABLE Orders (
    OrderId BIGINT PRIMARY KEY IDENTITY(1,1),
    ComId BIGINT NOT NULL,
    UserId BIGINT NOT NULL,
    OrderNo NVARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    TotalAmount DECIMAL(18,2) NOT NULL,
    Status INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,          -- 1=待支付, 2=已支付, 3=已发货, 4=已完成, 5=已取消
    CreatedAt DATETIME2 NOT NULL DEFAULT GETDATE(),
    UpdatedAt DATETIME2 NOT NULL DEFAULT GETDATE(),
    CONSTRAINT UK_Orders_OrderNo UNIQUE (OrderNo),
    CONSTRAINT FK_Orders_Users FOREIGN KEY (UserId) REFERENCES Users(UserId),
    INDEX IX_Orders_ComId (ComId),
    INDEX IX_Orders_UserId (UserId),
    INDEX IX_Orders_Status (Status),
    INDEX IX_Orders_CreatedAt (CreatedAt)
);
```

### Products（产品表）
```sql
CREATE TABLE Products (
    ProductId BIGINT PRIMARY KEY IDENTITY(1,1),
    ComId BIGINT NOT NULL,
    ProductName NVARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    Price DECIMAL(18,2) NOT NULL,
    Stock INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
    Status INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,          -- 1=上架, 2=下架, 3=删除
    CreatedAt DATETIME2 NOT NULL DEFAULT GETDATE(),
    UpdatedAt DATETIME2 NOT NULL DEFAULT GETDATE(),
    INDEX IX_Products_ComId (ComId),
    INDEX IX_Products_Status (Status)
);
```

