## 迁移规范

### 命名
```
YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_DescriptiveName.sql
```

### 幂等性
```sql
-- 创建表
IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT * FROM sys.tables WHERE name = 'Users')
BEGIN
    CREATE TABLE Users (...);
END

-- 添加字段
IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT * FROM sys.columns WHERE name = 'Email' AND object_id = OBJECT_ID('Users'))
BEGIN
    ALTER TABLE Users ADD Email NVARCHAR(100) NOT NULL;
END

-- 创建索引
IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT * FROM sys.indexes WHERE name = 'IX_Users_ComId')
BEGIN
    CREATE INDEX IX_Users_ComId ON Users(ComId);
END
```

### 回滚脚本
每个迁移必须有对应的回滚脚本：
```
YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_DescriptiveName_Up.sql
YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_DescriptiveName_Down.sql
```

